      "description": "We spent a night Lake Quinault lodge. They were celebrating their 100 year anniversary.  The lobby was a nice place to hang out. We ordered pizza at the bar and ate it there. We hiked some of the trails that start right across the street. There is a big lawn and view of the lake from the back. People were playing yard games. ",
